{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211290","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321129001:1":{"text":"得、得救了……幸好有你们在……！","source_cn":"得、得救了……幸好有你们在……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E0FE1C81EE8F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321129002:1":{"text":"你为什么要一个人跑出来呀？刚才真的太危险了。","source_cn":"你为什么要一个人跑出来呀？刚才真的太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE960B4D84DE735E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321129003:1":{"text":"抱歉，我只是想出来采一些果子，做成<style=\"highlight\">雪冻水果沙拉</style>，在祈祷的时候献给女神。","source_cn":"抱歉，我只是想出来采一些果子，做成<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EECA064BC68A7F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321129004:1":{"text":"但我没想到会遇到叶角熊……还要麻烦你们来救我……","source_cn":"但我没想到会遇到叶角熊……还要麻烦你们来救我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3981DCC350EF29D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321129005:1":{"text":"雪松水果沙拉是雪松镇的特产吗？听起来好好吃！","source_cn":"雪松水果沙拉是雪松镇的特产吗？听起来好好吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98C3C40EC8446F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","